{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power of the Horde</strong> is a fantastic <strong>RTS</strong>\u00a0with RPG features such as Hero and equipement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 factions\u2014<strong>Humans</strong>, <strong>Horde</strong>, and <strong>Undead</strong>\u2014each with 3 unique heroes and shared units. Every hero and unit has its own skill tree. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Equipement System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In both RTS and RPG modes, heroes can loot equipment from control points or bosses on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in an RPG, equipment has different stats and can be kept between games. Gear comes in different quality levels, from Normal to Mystic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic map mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On RTS skirmish maps, there are lots of interesting points to explore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By taking control of guarded points, heroes can earn experience and loot valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At mercenary camps and the Grand Arena, players can hire powerful neutral units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other interesting locationsare also worth visiting, such as the Fountain of Life or neutral villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AI Assistant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can activate the <strong>AI assistant</strong> to help them <strong>construct bases</strong>, <strong>train units</strong>, and even <strong>control units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI assistant can be configured to perform certain tasks, and players can even control just the hero, as in RPG games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features in developement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access ends on <strong>2026.07.05</strong>, bringing exciting new features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Mode (Available in 2026.03.15)</strong><br>Pick one hero and two captains to explore dungeon maps, defeat enemies and bosses, and loot powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Faction</strong><br>A 4th faction joins the battle, featuring 3 unique heroes and shared units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Maps</strong><br>Enjoy new RTS and RPG maps for even more battles and adventures.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1298430?t=1776906525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/26f418b24799f2bbfb76e5a1524be053e02033f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776906525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/bb34210ddd30d4003b3a0f141383f4e908c72b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776906525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/bb34210ddd30d4003b3a0f141383f4e908c72b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776906525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power of the Horde</strong> is a fantastic <strong>RTS</strong>\u00a0with RPG features such as Hero and equipement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 factions\u2014<strong>Humans</strong>, <strong>Horde</strong>, and <strong>Undead</strong>\u2014each with 3 unique heroes and shared units. Every hero and unit has its own skill tree. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hero Equipement System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In both RTS and RPG modes, heroes can loot equipment from control points or bosses on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like in an RPG, equipment has different stats and can be kept between games. Gear comes in different quality levels, from Normal to Mystic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/13004fc6037128f9e9d9a9d7cf93f2ce.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic map mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On RTS skirmish maps, there are lots of interesting points to explore:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By taking control of guarded points, heroes can earn experience and loot valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At mercenary camps and the Grand Arena, players can hire powerful neutral units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other interesting locationsare also worth visiting, such as the Fountain of Life or neutral villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/675fe670d51144db8b5aea0f1c5a309f.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">AI Assistant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player can activate the <strong>AI assistant</strong> to help them <strong>construct bases</strong>, <strong>train units</strong>, and even <strong>control units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI assistant can be configured to perform certain tasks, and players can even control just the hero, as in RPG games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.poster.avif?t=1776906525\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.webm?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/extras/b7c740b2df8626e990b21f5f6c45c89b.mp4?t=1776906525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features in developement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Early Access ends on <strong>2026.07.05</strong>, bringing exciting new features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Mode (Available in 2026.03.15)</strong><br>Pick one hero and two captains to explore dungeon maps, defeat enemies and bosses, and loot powerful equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Faction</strong><br>A 4th faction joins the battle, featuring 3 unique heroes and shared units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Maps</strong><br>Enjoy new RTS and RPG maps for even more battles and adventures.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Windforce"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298430/0904