nd keep equipment after matches. The AI assistant can also help you build bases and train units automatically.","steam_appid":1298430,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://x.com/StevenLuo4"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian, Dutch, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://x.com/StevenLuo4"}